        "<b>Split:</b> choose how much the tones, the noise and the transients get hit, so drums can stay punchy",
        "<b>Drive curve</b> with up to 8 draggable points: smash the mids, spare the sub",
        "<b>Level stays put:</b> DRIVE changes the character, not the volume. Dynamic drive, tone, mix and output clip",
        "<b>12 factory presets</b> with descriptions, including Bass Thickener, Lo-Fi Robot and Metallic Drums",
