            ("AUTO · PER BASS", "default PER BASS", "With a bass bounce: one shape per kind of bass, or computed ducks."),
            ("CLEARANCE", "0 – 24 dB · default 6 dB", "AUTO: how far each kick and snare should stand above the bass."),
