            ("SUB · PLUCK · MID · NOTE", "SHAPES panel · defaults PUNCH-THROUGH · SNAP · SMOOTH · HOLD", "PER BASS: the shape for kicks over each kind of bass. Snares use SNARE."),
            ("KICK", "0 – 100% · default 100%", "How deep the kicks duck."),
