            ("KICK · SNARE shape", "SHAPES panel · default PUNCH-THROUGH · QUICK", "Kicks and snares each have their own shape (rims use the snare's). Pick KICK or SNARE at the top of the SHAPES panel, then choose or edit that shape."),
            ("Hits", "click in the MAP view", "Switch single hits off or on."),
